      "stdout": "Move an external draft project (created with `draft project create --dir`) back\r\ninto the default Jianying/Capcut workspace.\r\nAuto-renames on name collision; PC only.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --ref TEXT REQUIRED Draft reference to import, e.g. local://my_project\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project import --ref local://my_external_draft\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use this command after `draft project create --dir <external-dir>`\r\n  when the external draft should be moved into the default workspace.\r\n",
